    "Take a short break, then try again." : {
      "comment" : "Fair use asks the learner to wait a moment before another map",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Mach eine kurze Pause und versuch es dann noch einmal."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Descansa un momento y vuelve a intentarlo."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Fais une courte pause, puis réessaie."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Fai una breve pausa, poi riprova."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "少し休んでから、もう一度お試しください。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "잠깐 쉬었다가 다시 시도해 보세요."
          }
        },
        "pl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Zrób krótką przerwę i spróbuj ponownie."
          }
        },
        "pt" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Faça uma pausa rápida e tente de novo."
          }
        },
        "tr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Kısa bir ara ver, sonra tekrar dene."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "That's all the new lessons for this month. They open again next month, or get Plus to keep going now." : {
      "comment" : "A free learner's map needs new lessons, and they started this month's",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Für diesen Monat hast du alle neuen Lektionen ausgeschöpft. Nächsten Monat sind wieder neue verfügbar. Mit Plus kannst du sofort weitermachen."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Llegaste al límite de lecciones nuevas de este mes. El próximo mes podrás tomar más o puedes obtener Plus para seguir ahora."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tu as atteint la limite de nouvelles leçons pour ce mois. Tu pourras en suivre d’autres le mois prochain ou passer à Plus pour continuer dès maintenant."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Hai raggiunto il limite di nuove lezioni per questo mese. Potrai seguirne altre il mese prossimo, oppure passa a Plus per continuare subito."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "今月の新しいレッスンはここまでです。来月また受けられます。Plusに登録すると、今すぐ続けられます。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "이번 달의 새 레슨은 여기까지예요. 다음 달에 다시 이용할 수 있고, Plus를 구독하면 지금 계속 학습할 수 있어요."
          }
        },
        "pl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "To już wszystkie nowe lekcje na ten miesiąc. Kolejne będą dostępne w przyszłym miesiącu. Przejdź na Plus, by uczyć się dalej już teraz."
          }
        },
        "pt" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Essas são todas as aulas novas deste mês. Mais aulas estarão disponíveis no mês que vem, ou assine o Plus para continuar agora."
          }
        },
        "tr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Bu ayki yeni ders hakkını kullandın. Gelecek ay yeni dersler açılacak. Hemen devam etmek istersen Plus’a geç."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "That's all the new lessons for today. They open again tomorrow, or get Plus to keep going now." : {
